{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To initialize a new Gerrit site, run:

  java -jar %%DATADIR%%/gerrit.war init -d /var/db/gerrit

Then enable and start the service:

  sysrc gerrit_enable=YES
  service gerrit start

Gerrit defaults to listening on http://*:8080 for HTTP and port 29418 for SSH.

More information: https://gerrit-documentation.storage.googleapis.com/Documentation/3.14.2/install.html
EOM
}
